<title>USA: U.S. stocks open largely unchanged.</title>
<headline>U.S. stocks open largely unchanged.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-08-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Wall Street stocks opened largely unchanged on Friday, as dealers looked forward to the release of economic data and a speech by Federal Reserve Chairman Alan Greeenspan.</p>
<p>The Dow industrial Average was down 2 at 5645.</p>
</text>
